ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# Optional override, defaults to claude-sonnet-5
CARD_SCAN_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# Optional: real eBay API integration (enrich.py / ebay_api.py). Without
# these, card-detail lookups and price estimates fall back to Claude's
# web_search tool steered at eBay -- everything still works, just less
# reliably than with real eBay data. Get these from your app's keys on
# developer.ebay.com. Use PRODUCTION keys for real listings -- sandbox
# only has eBay's fake test data.
# EBAY_CLIENT_ID=your-app-id
# EBAY_CLIENT_SECRET=your-cert-id
# EBAY_ENV=production
# Only affects the price estimate: whether your app actually returns real
# sold-comp data from EBAY_CLIENT_ID/SECRET above depends on whether the
# Marketplace Insights API is enabled for your application (not automatic
# on every account -- check developer.ebay.com). Card-detail lookups (the
# Browse API) don't need that extra access.
